            ["COMPONENT_BATTLERIFLE_PENHASHOP_SPECIALCARBINE_TOXIC_V1"] = "Toxic V1 is made for those who control the territory. Its battered finish and exposed radioactive fluid capture the essence of urban warfare and project pure, corrosive dominance.",
