            ["COMPONENT_BATTLERIFLE_PENHASHOP_SPECIALCARBINE_AGUA"] = "Give your opponents a reality check with the AQUA Special Carbine skin. Its vibrant colors and bubbles evoke a water blaster while concealing lethal power for those who stay cool under pressure.",
            ["COMPONENT_BATTLERIFLE_PENHASHOP_SPECIALCARBINE_GAME"] = "Level up your RP with the GAMER Special Carbine skin. Neon retro-gaming colors, console buttons and loading bars turn every clash into Game Over for your enemies.",
